<title>GERMANY: IG Metall spokesman expects summit meeting Monday.</title>
<headline>IG Metall spokesman expects summit meeting Monday.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The IG Metall metalworkers union said on Friday that the union was expecting to hold a summit meeting with employers on Monday and that talks would include the sick pay issue in overall 1997 wage negotiations.</p>
<p>The trade union spokesman spoke on the sidelines of an IG Metall board meeting to give official confirmation for central talks with employers to go ahead.</p>
<p>The spokesman said however he was &quot;quite pessimistic about the chances for an overall wage agreement.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;The positions are currently so wide apart,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
